'''PZ Scripts Data''' is a dataset which provides data regarding the [[Scripts]] parameters and syntax. It is notably used by the [[ZedScripts]] extension for [[Visual Studio Code]] and to generate the [[PZ API Documentation]].

== See also ==
* [[PZ API Documentation]]
* [[PZ Translation Data]]

